9157472437_7783909032279688869_n.png?_nc_cat=104&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=2I4De8dwKzEQ7kNvwGnQ54Q&_nc_oc=AdovdLZ7I2UdwVlIYlH1qvaoyJdGrJbnFbMnUWThB20q3GbcgQ-2VY0M66sT_51_Jvk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSr9lpuGPeZSJSuMXpLH1CEb61LDYEqWLnGOmY_BsX8eQ&oe=6AFDAEFA"}, "display_name": "(m)ORPH Mixed", "keywords": ["music", "mixed", "creativity", "audio", "immersive"], "long_description": "**(m)ORPH Mixed** is a mixed reality VR-Music experience created by audio technologist Kasson Crooker. The original Morph VR-Music app was released in 2021 and this brand new version focuses on an immersive, mixed reality experience.\n\n(m)ORPH is not a game, but lets players interact with spatial audio in real-time to create a dynamically evolving music environment. Immersive sound objects and abstract, audio-reactive visuals are all around your room, yielding an 360-degree experience that you get to control and explore. Morph was a 3rd place winner in the Meta Start Developers competition in 2025.\n\n# Musical Artists\n- Freezepop ~ \"Swimming Pool\"\n- Kodomo ~ \"Light Rain\"\n- Yumi Iwaki ~ \"Residual Echo\"\n- Tawnylawns ~ \"Easy Work\"\n- Khems ~ \"Forest Bathing\"\n- Dispak ~ \"Koshkina\"\n- Symbion Project ~ \"Nodus Tollens\" ft Mars Nord\n- ELYXR ~ \"Strange Stubborn Proud\" ft Kurt Larson\n- The JD's ~ \"Proust\"\n- Rocococo ~ \"Reject the Data\"", "short_description": "(m)ORPH Mixed is a mixed reality music experience for Meta Quest 3/3s created by audio technologist Kasson Crooker. (m)ORPH is not a game, but lets players interact with music in real-time to create a dynamically evolving sonic environment. Immersive sound objects and abstract, audio-reactive visuals are all around your room, yielding an 360-degree experience that you get to control and explore. The Morph app is free and comes with 2 songs and a small fee to unlock the rest of the songs."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url